        "title": "Interesting",
        "text": "Its an important pilgrimage for Hindus - but that aside its an interesting place for everyone to see. Loads of great photo opportunities with the sadhus of the temple with their matted hair & interesting clothing. It gets quite crowded, so avoid if you do not like crowds. From the temple you get views of the Bagmati river & the crematoria - very interesting. Has to answer a lot of existential questions to my little 7 year old post our visit here :)",
